  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluating the Impact of Economic Growth Programming in Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">impact evaluation of the sme development activity serbias economy has a high potential for sustained growth, and small and medium enterprises (smes) could be the key to that progress. however, recent trends show that serbias productivity is currently only about half of that of the u.s., germany, and other western economies. past economic growth programs in serbia have delivered results but without a rigorous evaluation, it is challenging to understand which interventions are most effective..</narrative>
  </description>
